OL,3,GNEWSAAbuser stalked ex after years of
OL,4,A'mental torture'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA domestic abuser who stalked his
OL,7,Fex-partner after subjecting her to
OL,8,Fyears of "mental torture" has been
OL,9,Fjailed for four and a half years.
OL,11,FDaniel Grainger, 40, made the woman's
OL,12,Flife a misery with his jealousy and
OL,13,Ffalse accusations of her cheating on
OL,14,Fhim exacerbated by his alcohol and
OL,15,Fcocaine binges, Teesside Crown Court
OL,16,Fheard.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
