OL,3,GNEWSAAbuser stalked ex after years of
OL,4,A'mental torture'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe woman, who met Grainger when she
OL,7,Fwas 17 and was with him for 15 years,
OL,8,Ftold the court she lived every day in
OL,9,F"constant fear" he would kill her,
OL,10,Fwhile a judge said it was one of the
OL,11,Fworst domestic abuse cases he had
OL,12,Fencountered.
OL,14,FGrainger, from Darlington, initially
OL,15,Fdenied wrongdoing but admitted coercive
OL,16,Fand controlling behaviour and stalking
OL,17,Fon the day his trial began.
